<p>A wave of fire emanates from you with a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6,</acronym> knocking back anything caught inside and setting them ablaze, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">108, 146, 175, 200, 222</acronym> fire damage over 3 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>